            <ArticleTitle>A sarcoidosis patient with hand involvement and large pulmonary lymph nodes: results of 1-year treatment with methotrexate.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S71-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s10067-010-1487-2</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sarcoidosis infrequently involves the phalanges and the adjacent soft tissue. The management of bone lesions is not clear. We present herein the results of methotrexate therapy applied for 1 year in a sarcoidosis patient with hand involvement and large hilar lymphadenopathies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
